<![CDATA[<p class="MsoBodyText3" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 45.4pt;"><span style="color: rgb(38, 38, 38);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your Insperity service team is thankful for the opportunity to
learn about your company and your business objectives for the coming year. Your
Insperity service team is available to help you create and enhance a solid
human resources infrastructure and implement the services most appropriate to
your objectives.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0in 0.2pt -0.25pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="color: rgb(38, 38, 38);"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0in 0.2pt -0.25pt; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(38, 38, 38);">Our proposal outlines the
Insperity services we believe can meet your business needs and objectives that
will help your business grow, support your employees, and enhance your company’s
culture. </span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in; text-indent: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(0, 80, 132);"><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span></span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0in 0in -0.25pt; line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="line-height: 107%; color: rgb(0, 80, 132);">About Your Business: </span><span style="line-height: 107%;"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0in 0.2pt -0.25pt;"><span style="line-height: 104%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Based on our discussion, we understand: <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

