</div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0in; text-indent: 0in;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="line-height: 104%; color: rgb(0, 80, 132);">Your Current Business </span><span style="line-height: 104%; color: rgb(0, 80, 132);">Opportunities:</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0in; text-indent: 0in;"></p><ol style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(38, 38, 38); text-indent: 0in;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Reduce risk and
administrative burden by maintaining an effective human capital infrastructure.</font></span></li><li style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ensure your
     Insperity Service plan increases the business value received from our
     partnership and resources<font color="#262626">.</font></font></li><li style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Document
     your policies and ensure a consistent communication of your organizations
